Source: whitesur-icon-theme
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), bash, coreutils, gtk-update-icon-cache, sed
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/vinceliuice/WhiteSur-icon-theme

Package: whitesur-icon-theme
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme
Description: WhiteSur macOS-like icon theme
 WhiteSur is a macOS-like icon theme for Linux desktops. This package ships
 the upstream 2026-09-10 release with every color variant.
